ii ayaaku, iina apajig shiig muumpakiu pujugtamji, tuja iina yachi tsakat pujawai iina apaji muumpakiu ai akiinauwa nunú. Tuja nunak iina apajig shiig senchi aneenuwe, wagki nunú nuwanmak jimag akiinau tikich jakamtai, makichik juwaku asamtai, timaiji.
